What is original to this fork
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Authored for this project:

  discover/vulkan_darwin.go
  discover/vulkan_darwin_test.go
  discover/vulkan_igpu_darwin.go
  discover/vulkan_igpu_darwin_test.go
